  "description": "Server-side (Razor) display and search rendering for Dignite.Abp.FlexFields: the <flex-field-view>/<flex-field-search> TagHelpers and default views for the eight built-in field types - the non-Angular counterpart to the Angular library's <ff-flex-field-view>/<ff-flex-field-search>. Zero IO: TagHelpers render an already-resolved FlexFieldValue, the same way the kernel has no application service of its own to look one up with. No config/control TagHelpers - display and search only.",
